      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Cornish%20Fairings\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EGinger Fairings\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 oz butter\u003Cbr\u003E\n6 oz self raising flour\u003Cbr\u003E\n3 oz soft brown sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tbsp golden syrup\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tsp ginger\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nPreheat oven to 190C, 375F, gas 5 and grease a baking tray. Beat together the butter and sugar. Add the remaining ingredients and mix well. Divide into walnut-sized balls, place each on the tray and press flat. Bake for approximately 15 minutes or until golden brown.\u003Cbr\u003E"
